  "notes": "Drawn from XA-VSK (Sept 2025, from below); the pixel mosaic is sketched with a few squares, not traced. Year of the scheme's introduction not confirmed here, so 'from' is left out. Specials (e.g. the '20 años' A321neo XA-XXV, 2026) aren't this scheme. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on XA-VSK, measured by its windows (the photo is from ahead and below, so a straight scale along the fuselage doesn't hold): 'volaris' starts about 1.1 m aft of the forward door's middle (x 0.139; it had been drawn 1.4 m further aft) and spans 19 window pitches (10.2 m, length 0.23); baseline about 0.75 m under the windows' middle, the l's top 0.77 m over it (y -0.023, height 0.51), lowercase 0.79 of the l. 'volaris.com' spans 4.8 m (0.108); its start is left as drawn. Volaris's commonest type is the A320neo; this was measured on the A321neo, where the title sits the same distance behind the door.",
  "history": "Replaces Skyarium v1's approximate standard (a few colors from memory)."
